//
// npu1 variant of objectfifo_cyclostatic_zero_trip_guard: both sides of the
// runtime-guarded peel, JITing a normal and a zero-trip design.
//
// Targeted at Phoenix so the #2463 peel is exercised on both architectures
// in CI. Reuses the sibling directory's IRON test.py; %run_on_npu1% drives
// @iron.jit to the npu1 device.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu1, peano, xrt_python_bindings
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu1% %python %S/../objectfifo_cyclostatic_zero_trip_guard/test.py
